  "notes": [
    "Original install is read only. Exported JSON contains gameplay facts; no original executable code or game media is distributed.",
    "Main-wave oracle v3 executes the original scheduler, path_db and grid_db using native start nodes. Headless rendering/audio helpers are stubbed. Three reference seeds are recorded.",
    "Extra-wave oracle executes native mega_spawner for stages 23, 24 and 26, retaining exact ticks, lane, subpath, node, origin and forced waypoint.",
    "Reference traces are isolated scheduling observations. Live gameplay random decisions may consume RNG in a different order; numeric damage uses the project deterministic RNG.",
    "Map imagery and hero/enemy appearance use project assets; faithful original animation and scenery painting are deferred by user instruction.",
    "Legion coroutine observation: generation budget 2 makes two children of budget 1; budget 1 makes one child of budget 0. Each entity has a finite copy budget. Render/movement waiting stubs make these timestamps unsuitable as timing acceptance."
  ]
